<!-- NWP-20261010-13: the telephony notices' small icon: an envelope, white on a transparent field, because a small
     icon is flattened to one tinted colour (alpha only). It replaces android.R.drawable.sym_action_email, a legacy
     full-colour glyph the status bar and the lock screen drew as a blot. A 2-unit frame (the inner rectangle cut out
     by evenOdd) and the flap as one V-shaped band. It is the message notices' icon only: TelIngest's in-session message
     notices and the gate's message notices in SmsDeliverReceiver. Since NWP-20261123-24 the gate's call notices
     ("Incoming call", "Missed call", and their "may not have been saved" forms) and the session's missed call
     (TelIngest.postMissedCallNotice) draw the handset ic_notif_call. -->
